  <HH.Setting.kitchen.shelfLife>菜品保鲜期</HH.Setting.kitchen.shelfLife>
  <HH.Setting.kitchen.shelfLife.Desc>盘装菜品能保持新鲜多久，相对于每道菜 3 到 24 小时的基础值。变味的菜仍可食用，但不再提供饱足和心情加成。</HH.Setting.kitchen.shelfLife.Desc>
  <HH.Setting.kitchen.wellFedStrength>饱足强度</HH.Setting.kitchen.wellFedStrength>
  <HH.Setting.kitchen.wellFedStrength.Desc>正经菜肴之后饥饿下降的减缓程度（100% = 慢 40%）。</HH.Setting.kitchen.wellFedStrength.Desc>
  <HH.Setting.kitchen.wellFedDuration>饱足持续时间</HH.Setting.kitchen.wellFedDuration>
  <HH.Setting.kitchen.wellFedDuration.Desc>饱足状态持续多久，相对于按烹饪等级（及品质）计算的 4 / 6 / 8 / 10 小时。</HH.Setting.kitchen.wellFedDuration.Desc>
  <HH.Setting.kitchen.menuPrice>菜单价格</HH.Setting.kitchen.menuPrice>
