  <HH.Setting.kitchen.poisonRule>好厨房不会食物中毒</HH.Setting.kitchen.poisonRule>
  <HH.Setting.kitchen.poisonRule.Desc>由烹饪 4 级及以上的厨师在干净厨房（清洁度 -0.2 或更好）做出的菜永远不会导致中毒。关闭则使用原版规则。</HH.Setting.kitchen.poisonRule.Desc>
  <HH.Setting.kitchen.variants>精品与招牌形式</HH.Setting.kitchen.variants>
  <HH.Setting.kitchen.variants.Desc>为每道菜提供精品形式（食材更多更好，更有机会做出好品质）和招牌形式（需要研究）。</HH.Setting.kitchen.variants.Desc>
